Beynendaye tamasha, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Sadal wida hussaina, wahasrata hussaina<br>
<br>
Zaqmi Shuda khudara, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Az taziya na harja, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Pehlue Binte Zehra, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Sadal wida Hussaina, wahasrata hussaina<br>
<br>
Goye Zehra Hazina, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Werana shud Madina, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Shud be pidar Sakina, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Sadal wida Hussaina, wahasrata hussaina<br>
<br>
Az markat ain aseer shud, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Range jahan digar shud, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Zainab barehna sar shud, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Sadal wida Hussaina, wahasrata hussaina<br>
<br>
Goye Sakina pur gham, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Az daste shimra zulm, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Khoon shud rawaa zigo sham, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Sadal wida Hussaina, wahasrata hussaina<br>
<br>
Bastand qoume ada, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Dareyk rasan be azeed, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Aale Rasool khudara, wahasrata hussaina<br>
Sadal wida Hussaina, wahasrata hussaina<br>
<br>
Kursi nasheen sitamgar, wahasrata hussaina<br>
